        <technology>
            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en"># Included processes\nWind turbine moving parts (without tower and substructure), at site including manufacturing, transports, installation, replacements, decommission and waste treatement. Calculated for FU of 1p.\nData are based on the plant IEA reference 10MW offshore wind turbine.\nThe distance to installation port is assumed to be 80 km.\nAssumed lifetime is 25 years.\n\nMain data source: \nKainz, S. (2025). Life Cycle Inventory of the IEA Wind 740-10-MW Reference Offshore Wind Plant with irregular layout [Dataset]. Zenodo. https://doi.org/10.5281/ZENODO.15880601\n</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
